">give </span><span begin="01:02.950" end="01:03.070">you </span><span begin="01:03.070" end="01:03.850">space </span><span begin="01:03.850" end="01:03.850">（</span><span begin="01:03.850" end="01:03.940">You </span><span begin="01:03.940" end="01:04.300">space</span><span begin="01:04.300" end="01:04.330">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.330" end="01:07.630"><span begin="01:04.330" end="01:04.570">Girl</span><span begin="01:04.570" end="01:04.570">, </span><span begin="01:04.570" end="01:04.780">when </span><span begin="01:04.780" end="01:04.960">you're </span><span begin="01:04.960" end="01:05.410">ready</span><span begin="01:05.410" end="01:05.410">, </span><span begin="01:05.410" end="01:05.590">you </span><span begin="01:05.590" end="01:05.830">know </span><span begin="01:05.830" end="01:06.220">where </span><span begin="01:06.220" end="01:06.370">I </span><span begin="01:06.370" end="01:07.630">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.660" end="01:10.660"><span begin="01:07.660" end="01:07.810">When </span><span begin="01:07.810" end="01:07.870">it </span><span begin="01:07.870" end="01:08.110">comes </span><span begin="01:08.110" end="01:08.260">to </span><span begin="01:08.260" end="01:08.500">all </span><span begin="01:08.500" end="01:08.710">these </span><span begin="01:08.710" end="01:09.010">hoes</span><span begin="01:09.010" end="01:09.010">, </span><span begin="01:09.010" end="01:09.130">I'll </span><span begin="01:09.130" end="01:09.580">never </span><span begin="01:09.580" end="01:10.660">chase</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.900" end="01:13.930"><span begin="01:10.900" end="01:11.050">But </span><span begin="01:11.050" end="01:11.200">this </span><span begin="01:11.200" end="01:11.410">world </span><span begin="01:11.410" end="01:11.530">is </span><span begin="01:11.530" end="01:11.830">such </span><span begin="01:11.830" end="01:11.920">a</span><span begin="01:11.920" end="01:11.920">, </span><span begin="01:11.920" end="01